{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"947c50fd263b13cc","__entryId":"commit","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git add index.html</b></span>\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git commit -m \"修复按钮在手机上错位\"</b></span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">[main e7b2d48]</span> 修复按钮在手机上错位</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\"> 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">源代码管理 <span style=\"margin-left:auto;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;padding:0 6px\">2</span></div>\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:6px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">消息（按 ⌘Enter 提交）</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:6px 12px 2px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">更改</div>\n      <div style=\"padding:2px 12px 10px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;padding:3px 0\"><span style=\"flex:1\">📄 index.html</span><span style=\"color:var(--warning);font-weight:600\">M</span></div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;padding:3px 0\"><span style=\"flex:1\">📄 style.css</span><span style=\"color:var(--warning);font-weight:600\">M</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:0 12px 12px\"><div style=\"background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);text-align:center;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 0;font-size:12px\">✓ 提交</div></div>\n      <div style=\"background:#eaf2ff;color:var(--info);font-size:12px;padding:4px 12px\">⑂ main*　⊘ 0　⚠ 0</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git log --oneline</b></span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">e7b2d48</span> 修复按钮在手机上错位</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">a3f9c21</span> 完成首页导航栏</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">b4c5d67</span> 首页基础版本</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">0f1e2d3</span> 初始化项目</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">前 7 位是短哈希值，可用于定位提交</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">完成首页导航栏</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\">oil-oil committed 2 小时前　<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace\">a3f9c21</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:6px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);background:var(--bg-soft)\">📄 index.html　<span style=\"color:#16a34a\">+48</span> <span style=\"color:var(--red)\">-5</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;padding:8px 0\">\n        <div style=\"background:var(--red-light);color:#82071e;padding:0 14px\">- &lt;nav&gt;旧导航&lt;/nav&gt;</div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--green-light);color:#116329;padding:0 14px\">+ &lt;nav class=\"top-nav\"&gt;新导航&lt;/nav&gt;</div>\n        <div style=\"color:var(--text-3);padding:0 14px\">　&lt;main&gt;…&lt;/main&gt;</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git add index.html</b></span>\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git commit -m \"Repair button is misplaced on mobile phone\"</b></span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">[main e7b2d48]</span> Fix button misplacement on mobile phone</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\"> 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Source code management <span style=\"margin-left:auto;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;padding:0 6px\">2</span></div>\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:6px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Message (press ⌘Enter to submit)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:6px 12px 2px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Change</div>\n      <div style=\"padding:2px 12px 10px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;padding:3px 0\"><span style=\"flex:1\">📄 index.html</span><span style=\"color:var(--warning);font-weight:600\">M</span></div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;padding:3px 0\"><span style=\"flex:1\">📄 style.css</span><span style=\"color:var(--warning);font-weight:600\">M</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:0 12px 12px\"><div style=\"background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);text-align:center;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 0;font-size:12px\">✓ Submit</div></div>\n      <div style=\"background:#eaf2ff;color:var(--info);font-size:12px;padding:4px 12px\">⑂ main*　⊘ 0　⚠ 0</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git log --oneline</b></span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">e7b2d48</span> Fix button alignment on mobile</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">a3f9c21</span> Finish the home-page navigation</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">b4c5d67</span> Home page basic version</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">0f1e2d3</span> Initialize project</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">The first 7 bits are a short hash that can be used to identify the commit</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">Finish the home-page navigation</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\">maya-lee committed 2 hours ago <span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace\">a3f9c21</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:6px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);background:var(--bg-soft)\">📄 index.html　<span style=\"color:#16a34a\">+48</span> <span style=\"color:var(--red)\">-5</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;padding:8px 0\">\n        <div style=\"background:var(--red-light);color:#82071e;padding:0 14px\">- &lt;nav&gt;Old navigation&lt;/nav&gt;</div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--green-light);color:#116329;padding:0 14px\">+ &lt;nav class=\"top-nav\"&gt;New navigation&lt;/nav&gt;</div>\n        <div style=\"color:var(--text-3);padding:0 14px\">&lt;main&gt;…&lt;/main&gt;</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"cn":"选择改动","en":"git add","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git add index.html</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git add index.html</span>","when":"指定下一次 commit 要记录的改动","when_en":"Specify the changes to be recorded in the next commit"},{"cn":"创建提交","en":"git commit","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git commit -m \"说明\"</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git commit -m \"Description\"</span>","when":"完成一个可独立说明的改动后","when_en":"After completing an independently explainable change"},{"cn":"查看提交","en":"git log","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git log --oneline</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git log --oneline</span>","when":"查看提交记录或在恢复前定位提交","when_en":"View commit history or locate a commit before reverting"},{"cn":"看看现状","en":"git status","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git status</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git status</span>","when":"不确定改了哪些文件，先问它","when_en":"Not sure which files were changed, ask it first"}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"git status 同时显示 index.html 和 .env 有改动，这次只想提交首页导航。怎么做更安全？","options":[{"id":"stage-scope","label":"只暂存 index.html，检查暂存区差异，再提交“修复首页导航”","feedback":"对。先限定本次范围并检查暂存区，可以避免把 .env 里的密钥写进版本历史。","correct":true},{"id":"stage-all","label":"运行 git add .，把两个文件一起提交，之后再整理","feedback":"git add . 会把 .env 一起放进暂存区。密钥一旦进入历史，删除文件也不等于消除泄露风险。","correct":false},{"id":"commit-secret-later","label":"先提交 .env，推送前再从最新版本里删掉","feedback":"删掉最新文件不会抹去之前的提交记录。密钥进入历史后应立即轮换。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"git status shows changes in index.html and .env, but this commit should contain only the homepage navigation. What is safer?","options":[{"id":"stage-scope","label":"Stage only index.html, inspect the staged diff, then commit with “Fix homepage navigation”","feedback":"Correct. Limiting and reviewing the staged changes keeps secrets from .env out of version history.","correct":true},{"id":"stage-all","label":"Run git add . and commit both files, then clean it up later","feedback":"git add . would stage .env too. Once a secret enters history, deleting the latest file does not remove the exposure.","correct":false},{"id":"commit-secret-later","label":"Commit .env now and delete it from the latest version before pushing","feedback":"Deleting the latest copy does not erase earlier commits. A secret that enters history should be rotated.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请先查看 git status 和 diff，只提交首页导航相关改动，排除 .env。提交说明写清完成了什么。提交后告诉我 commit hash，并确认这次还没有 push。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Inspect git status and the diff first. Commit only the homepage navigation changes and exclude .env. Write a message that says what was completed. After committing, give me the commit hash and confirm that nothing has been pushed yet."}},"demoDetail":"<div class=\"git-story git-story--commit is-detail\">\n  <div class=\"git-story-main\"><div class=\"git-simple-flow git-simple-flow--commit\">\n      <div class=\"git-file-card is-change\"><span class=\"git-file-mark\"></span><span><b>导航栏改好了</b><small>这还是当前改动</small></span></div>\n      <div class=\"git-motion\"><span>保存为一个版本</span><small>commit</small><i>→</i></div>\n      <div class=\"git-version-card is-new\"><span class=\"git-version-check\">✓</span><span><b>完成首页导航</b><small>刚刚 · 保存在这台电脑</small></span><span class=\"git-version-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i class=\"is-current\"></i></span></div>\n    </div></div>\n  <div class=\"git-story-answer\"><span class=\"git-command\">git commit -m \"完成首页导航\"</span><p>Commit 是给这次改动建立一个有名字的版本记录。它先保存在本机；要让 GitHub 也收到，还需要 Push。\n</p></div>\n</div>","references":[{"title":"git-commit 官方文档","source":"git-scm","url":"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-commit","title_en":"Git - git-commit Documentation"},{"title":"记录仓库的改动（Pro Git）","source":"git-scm","url":"https://git-scm.com/book/en/v2/Git-Basics-Recording-Changes-to-the-Repository","title_en":"Pro Git - Recording Changes to the Repository"}],"scenes":["终端里 add + commit","VS Code 源代码管理面板","git log 查看提交记录","GitHub 查看一次 commit 的 diff"],"en":{"demoDetail":"<div class=\"git-story git-story--commit is-detail\">\n  <div class=\"git-story-main\"><div class=\"git-simple-flow git-simple-flow--commit\">\n      <div class=\"git-file-card is-change\"><span class=\"git-file-mark\"></span><span><b>The navigation bar has been changed</b><small>This is still the current change</small></span></div>\n      <div class=\"git-motion\"><span>Save as a version</span><small>commit</small><i>→</i></div>\n      <div class=\"git-version-card is-new\"><span class=\"git-version-check\">✓</span><span><b>Complete homepage navigation</b><small>Just saved on this computer</small></span><span class=\"git-version-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i class=\"is-current\"></i></span></div>\n    </div></div>\n  <div class=\"git-story-answer\"><span class=\"git-command\">git commit -m \"Complete homepage navigation\"</span><p>Commit is to create a named version record for this change. It is saved locally first; in order for GitHub to receive it, it needs to be pushed.\n</p></div>\n</div>","use":[],"dont":[],"scenes":["Feature step","Bug fix","Copy update","Refactor checkpoint"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git add index.html</b></span>\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git commit -m \"Repair button is misplaced on mobile phone\"</b></span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">[main e7b2d48]</span> Fix button misplacement on mobile phone</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\"> 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Source code management <span style=\"margin-left:auto;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;padding:0 6px\">2</span></div>\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:6px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Message (press ⌘Enter to submit)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:6px 12px 2px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Change</div>\n      <div style=\"padding:2px 12px 10px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;padding:3px 0\"><span style=\"flex:1\">📄 index.html</span><span style=\"color:var(--warning);font-weight:600\">M</span></div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;padding:3px 0\"><span style=\"flex:1\">📄 style.css</span><span style=\"color:var(--warning);font-weight:600\">M</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:0 12px 12px\"><div style=\"background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);text-align:center;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 0;font-size:12px\">✓ Submit</div></div>\n      <div style=\"background:#eaf2ff;color:var(--info);font-size:12px;padding:4px 12px\">⑂ main*　⊘ 0　⚠ 0</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git log --oneline</b></span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">e7b2d48</span> Fix button alignment on mobile</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">a3f9c21</span> Finish the home-page navigation</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">b4c5d67</span> Home page basic version</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">0f1e2d3</span> Initialize project</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">The first 7 bits are a short hash that can be used to identify the commit</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">Finish the home-page navigation</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:2px\">maya-lee committed 2 hours ago <span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace\">a3f9c21</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:6px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);background:var(--bg-soft)\">📄 index.html　<span style=\"color:#16a34a\">+48</span> <span style=\"color:var(--red)\">-5</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;padding:8px 0\">\n        <div style=\"background:var(--red-light);color:#82071e;padding:0 14px\">- &lt;nav&gt;Old navigation&lt;/nav&gt;</div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--green-light);color:#116329;padding:0 14px\">+ &lt;nav class=\"top-nav\"&gt;New navigation&lt;/nav&gt;</div>\n        <div style=\"color:var(--text-3);padding:0 14px\">&lt;main&gt;…&lt;/main&gt;</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git add index.html</span>","when":"Specify the changes to be recorded in the next commit"},{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git commit -m \"Description\"</span>","when":"After completing an independently explainable change"},{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git log --oneline</span>","when":"View commit history or locate a commit before reverting"},{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git status</span>","when":"Not sure which files were changed, ask it first"}]}}}